prompts.blocks:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: transparent sprite sheet for a children's wooden Block Stacker game.
Input reference is material/style only, especially the MIDDLE phone's colored wooden blocks.
Create exactly 8 separate rectangular painted wood blocks arranged precisely in a 2-column by 4-row grid on transparent background. Each block horizontal 4:1 width-to-height, flat front view, NO perspective skew. Block corners softly rounded. Rich tactile horizontal wood grain, little carved nicks, brushstroke texture, subtle honey-colored edge wear. A slender bevel on top and lower edge give depth. Match warm handmade reference, NOT glass, plastic, buttons, flat vector or glossy rubber.
Canvas 1024x1024. Each grid cell512x256, one block centered in every cell occupying width440,height110. Keep transparent gaps everywhere between blocks. NO floor shadow beyond 3px. NO words, symbols, eyes, faces, icons, numbers.
Rows from top to bottom:
row1: coral red block left, orange tangerine block right;
row2: butter yellow left, leaf green right;
row3: sky cyan blue left, lavender purple right;
row4: warm rose pink left, metallic warm golden-yellow right.
All 8 share same geometry and lighting: lit from upper left with brighter top edge and rich dark lower side. No surrounding objects. True transparency.
